flowchart TD
    TRAFFIC["🌐 Live Network Traffic\nTCP / UDP / ICMP Stream"]:::node

    TRAFFIC --> CAP["📦 Packet Capture\nScapy · Wireshark"]:::node
    CAP --> EXTRACT["🔧 Feature Extraction\n• Packet size distribution\n• Flow duration & timing\n• Protocol anomalies\n• Behavioural signatures"]:::process

    EXTRACT --> LSTM["🧠 LSTM Classifier\n128 → 64 units\nBidirectional · Dropout 0.2"]:::model
    EXTRACT --> ISO["🔍 Isolation Forest\nContamination: 0.01\nEstimators: 200"]:::model
    EXTRACT --> AUTO["📐 AutoEncoder\nEncoder-Decoder\nReconstruction error scoring"]:::model

    LSTM & ISO & AUTO --> ENSEMBLE["🗳️ Ensemble Voting\nWeighted majority vote\n+ confidence scoring"]:::ensemble

    ENSEMBLE -->|"Score > 0.85"| THREAT["⚠️ THREAT DETECTED\nSeverity: CRITICAL / HIGH / MED\nMITRE ATT&CK Mapping"]:::alert
    ENSEMBLE -->|"Score < 0.15"| SAFE["✅ CLEAN TRAFFIC\nPassed all checks\nLogged & archived"]:::safe

    THREAT --> BLOCK["🔒 Auto-Block\nFirewall rule push"]:::action
    THREAT --> REPORT["📊 Threat Report\nIOC extraction"]:::action
    THREAT --> NOTIFY["📡 Alert Dispatch\nSIEM · SOAR · Email"]:::action

    classDef node fill:#020c18,stroke:#00e5ff,color:#cdd9e5
    classDef process fill:#020c18,stroke:#00e5ff,color:#00e5ff
    classDef model fill:#061220,stroke:#b06aff,color:#b06aff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ensemble fill:#020c18,stroke:#00ff9d,color:#00ff9d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef alert fill:#1a0800,stroke:#ff5e1a,color:#ff5e1a
    classDef safe fill:#001a08,stroke:#00ff9d,color:#00ff9d
    classDef action fill:#020c18,stroke:#00e5ff,color:#00e5ff